                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white font-black flex items-center justify-center text-sm">2</span>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">설계 및 건축 인허가 단계</h3>
